Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.40,0:00:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯已经证明了自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus has proven himself,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.06,0:00:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,赐予他的奖赏是自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}let him be rewarded with freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,你赢得了鲁迪斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have earned the rudis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.68,0:00:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,证明你不再是个奴隶了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}proof you no longer stand a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.50,0:00:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你的爱妻背叛了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your wife betrayed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.80,0:00:17.11,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一次上床\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One last fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.11,0:00:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我们罗马战士要拼到最后一滴血…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And we will fight till the last drop of Roman blood{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.73,0:00:21.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我不是罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not a Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.72,0:00:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,妮维雅死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naevia is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.34,0:00:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,你他妈的混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fucking shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.57,0:00:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我要杀了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'll fucking kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:28.65,Default,,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you lost mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.65,0:00:30.15,Default,,0,0,0,,妮维雅还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naevia lives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.31,0:00:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不要为这事儿送命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not fucking die for this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.27,0:00:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,不要让他们今晚就倒在了这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have these men not fall here tonight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.10,0:00:42.84,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们去角斗场 当着整个卡普亚战死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but in the arena before all of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,先取得你父亲的同意解除婚约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gain your father's approval to dissolve your marriage,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.37,0:00:49.39,Default,,0,0,0,,再带着你湿漉漉的身子来找我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and find me as wet with desire as you now stand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.27,0:00:56.10,Default,,0,0,0,,《斯巴达克斯：复仇》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.75,0:00:59.80,Default,,0,0,0,,《自由》
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.14,0:01:03.31,Default,,0,0,0,,杀 杀 杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill! Kill! Kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.90,0:02:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,精彩的对决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A fine showing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.49,0:02:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,将永远为狂热的民众所铭记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To be forever remembered by adoring crowd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.26,0:02:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,正如赐予他们如此盛宴的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As will the name Varinius,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:38.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你瓦里留斯的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who bestows such generous gifts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.25,0:02:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,的确\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.13,0:02:41.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他永远不会被忘记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He shall never be forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.89,0:02:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,有的人就未必了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Same cannot be said of all men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.17,0:02:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望有更多像你一样的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would there've more stood your equal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.68,0:02:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜世上唯一的瓦里留斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A pity there is but one of him,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.10,0:02:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,很快就要受召回罗马了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}so soon recalled to Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.47,0:02:54.36,Default,,0,0,0,,您此行短暂 却使我们获益良多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A brief yet profitable stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.36,0:02:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,您慷慨举办的角斗比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your games have given the city{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.79,0:02:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,对于这座城市来说真是雪中送炭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}much needed distraction in these dark times.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.33,0:03:02.13,Default,,0,0,0,,行刑开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The executions begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.13,0:03:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,为我们卡普亚此行画上完美的句号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A glorious finale to our stay at Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.65,0:03:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,要是斯巴达克斯也在就好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If only Spartacus were among the condemned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.53,0:03:09.59,Default,,0,0,0,,他早晚逃不了一死 蒙卡图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The man shall be put to grass soon enough, Mercato.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.59,0:03:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我的手下正一步步逼近他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My men move towards this very purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.39,0:03:14.89,Default,,0,0,0,,在此之前 我们就拿鲜血盛宴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Until such a time let us send message,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.11,0:03:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,震慑那些叛贼吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}punctuated in blood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.28,0:03:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,汉尼拔来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hannibal stands at our gates!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.84,0:03:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,这是罗马人用来吓唬小孩的说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A phrase used to invoke fear among the children of Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.99,0:03:32.47,Default,,0,0,0,,迦太基野兽的幽灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A specter of the Carthaginian animal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.47,0:03:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,多年以前曾经笼罩着这座城市\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who besieged this city with terror and death many years past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.11,0:03:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,但正如共和国所有敌人的命运一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet as is the fate of all enemies of the Republic,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.51,0:03:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,汉尼拔最终命丧罗马人剑下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hannibal passed from this life at the end of a Roman sword!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.05,0:03:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,叛贼斯巴达克斯终有一天也是同样的下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A fate that will one day be shared by the rebel Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.14,0:03:53.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不正是你的远房亲戚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was it not your distant relative,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.69,0:03:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,阿庇乌斯•克罗迪斯•帕尔契尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Appius Claudius Pulcher,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.50,0:03:57.13,Default,,0,0,0,,在卡普亚的首次战斗中\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who failed to defeat Hannibal{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.13,0:03:59.40,Default,,0,0,0,,败在了汉尼拔手下吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in the first battle of Capua?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.35,0:04:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.64,0:04:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,尽管诸神尚未赐予我们如此愉悦的时刻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gods have yet to bless us with such glorious sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.06,0:04:11.25,Default,,0,0,0,,却让我们看到了这一天来临前的曙光\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet they grace us with portent upon horizon!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.25,0:04:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯最为倚仗的三条走狗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Three of Spartacus' most trusted men,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.83,0:04:18.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的死可以警告所有胆敢挑战罗马的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}their deaths to serve as warning to all who would challenge Rome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.00,0:04:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了这帮畜生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill those bastards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.72,0:04:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,准备受死吧 你们这帮混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get ready to die! You fuckers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.30,0:04:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,今日胜出成为骁将的勇士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Their blood to be shed at the gladium{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.47,0:04:38.69,Default,,0,0,0,,将在竞技场上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}by the warriors whose victories{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.70,0:04:42.00,Default,,0,0,0,,亲手结束他们的性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}this day have earned them position in the primus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.52,0:04:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,谁能领导罗马的行刑者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet who shall lead the forces of Rome?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.48,0:04:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,谁配得上如此传奇的一战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who deserves such storied battle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.64,0:04:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There stands but one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.98,0:04:53.11,Default,,0,0,0,,本城唯一一位\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The only gladiator from this fair city{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.11,0:04:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,在竞技场赢得自由的角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to ever earn his freedom upon the sands!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.30,0:04:58.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的竞技场之神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A true God of the Arena!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.68,0:05:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,有请\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I give you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.47,0:05:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯 甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus! Gannicus! Gannicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.33,0:05:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他们 甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill them, Gannicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:28.30,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill them all!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.57,0:05:32.01,Default,,0,0,0,,他为什么要这么做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why would he do this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.35,0:05:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,因为他是一个毫无荣誉的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because he's a man without honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.37,0:05:46.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我们终于在竞技场上见面了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We at last face each other upon the sands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.99,0:05:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,正如梅莉塔所害怕的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As Melitta always feared.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.94,0:06:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,谣言是真的吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it true?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.75,0:06:04.56,Default,,0,0,0,,她去世的前一晚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Did you lay with her,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.79,0:06:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你跟她上床了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the night she left this world?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.39,0:06:10.73,Default,,0,0,0,,奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oenomaus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.50,0:06:16.77,Default,,0,0,0,,开战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.31,0:06:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,(一天前)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.42,0:06:40.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不应该兵分两路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We should not have torn our forces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,如果当初跟你们一起进了矿区\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we had been with you at the mines...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.68,0:06:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,更多的人会死在矿坑里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even more would lay dead within its tunnels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.21,0:06:50.03,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都有错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mistakes were made on both sides.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.54,0:06:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,如果总是耿耿于怀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us place them behind us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.07,0:06:57.07,Default,,0,0,0,,早晚会重蹈覆辙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}or risk finding them repeated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.04,0:07:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们有发现了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have found something...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.01,0:07:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神总算给了我们一点好处\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Finally, the gods show fucking favour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.86,0:07:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,先看看是多大的好处吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us see to what extent...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.37,0:07:55.64,Default,,0,0,0,,把大家带过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Bring the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.13,0:08:00.01,Default,,0,0,0,,四处搜寻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Search for weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.01,0:08:01.77,Default,,0,0,0,,说不定有留下的武器\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Something may have been left behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.68,0:08:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,终于有遮风挡雨的地方了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A roof over our heads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.40,0:08:13.27,Default,,0,0,0,,勉强算是吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ah, mostly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.90,0:08:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得养精蓄锐 计划一下未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We shall take rest, consider future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.21,0:08:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,在老子的神庙里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There holds none for you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:22.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你们可没有什么未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in my fucking temple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.50,0:08:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,看来诸神终于要送老子上西天了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}So the gods finally fuck me to the afterlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.44,0:08:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不如一起去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Care to join me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.73,0:08:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们只是找个栖身之地\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We seek only shelter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.35,0:08:53.79,Default,,0,0,0,,别无所求\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nothing more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.11,0:08:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.50,0:08:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,你是斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are Spartacus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.95,0:09:01.26,Default,,0,0,0,,正是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.77,0:09:11.53,Default,,0,0,0,,那是我有眼无珠了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I mistake fucking for blessing!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.96,0:09:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,这座神庙好多年没人光顾了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This temple has remained absent worship for many years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.73,0:09:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿虽说没啥好东西让人享受\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It does not offer much in the way of comforts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.83,0:09:24.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不过有我的自然有你们的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}but I would share what I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.31,0:09:26.61,Default,,0,0,0,,感谢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.78,0:09:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马人说的话 送来的酒 你敢相信\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would trust wine and words from a Roman shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.32,0:09:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,那你又是什么东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And what are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.68,0:09:34.59,Default,,0,0,0,,这么没教养 是高卢人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A Gaul, by your lack of manners?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.59,0:09:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我才不是高卢人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am no fucking Gaul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.44,0:09:38.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫艾力冈 来自莱茵河东岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am Agron, from the lands east of the Rhine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.75,0:09:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我叫卢修斯 是罗马西莲氏族的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I am Lucius, a Roman of the Caelian clan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.05,0:09:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,真是他妈的幸会了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A pleasure to make fucking acquaintance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.66,0:09:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,你为什么来这儿 卢修斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why are you here, Lucius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.86,0:09:54.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前的住处可气派了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did have more esteemed lodgings once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.43,0:09:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,一座宅子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.14,0:09:58.19,Default,,0,0,0,,有土地 有马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Land, horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.32,0:10:00.99,Default,,0,0,0,,还有家庭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.38,0:10:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,全让苏拉昧着良心夺走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Struck from this world by Sulla's black heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.48,0:10:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,苏拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Sulla?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.81,0:10:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,他也是罗马人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He too was a Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.75,0:10:10.85,Default,,0,0,0,,却反过来杀害自己人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet marched upon his own people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.85,0:10:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,镇压胆敢反抗他的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Punishing any who dared to defy him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.30,0:10:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你听到我的名字时 似乎眼睛一亮\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your eyes seemed to brighten, when you heard my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.83,0:10:39.33,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马人不该这样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unexpected from a Roman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.73,0:10:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也屠杀了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The ones I held to heart{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.82,0:10:45.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我的至亲们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}were slaughtered by the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.18,0:10:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,他们早已不是我的族人了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They stand no kin to me now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.18,0:10:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,然而\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.81,0:10:56.32,Default,,0,0,0,,谁让他们受苦受难\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the man who would make them suffer,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.68,0:10:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我就和谁称兄道弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would gladly call brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.60,0:11:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,这些话怎么不早说 现在连酒也没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You could not have made speech before swilling the last of the wine?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.40,0:11:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,早知道你们光顾神庙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Had I known you were for this temple,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.26,0:11:12.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我就攒满一屋子好酒\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'd have stocked it to the fucking rafters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我听说很多人死在卢卡尼亚矿区了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought the lot of you fallen in the mines of Lucania.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.67,0:11:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,你从哪儿听说的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where have you heard such tale?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,在那不勒斯的街道上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the streets of Neapolis,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:23.85,Default,,0,0,0,,那里消息很多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}frequented for trading.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.85,0:11:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你们失败 整座城市闹得沸沸扬扬\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The city is afire with news of your defeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.85,0:11:30.65,Default,,0,0,0,,幸存者即将在瓦里留斯的比赛中处决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The only survivors to be executed at Varinius' fucking games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.65,0:11:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,幸存者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Survivors?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.31,0:11:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,知道名字吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give names.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.72,0:11:35.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我只知道有三个人会血洒沙场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know only that three stand for the sands ...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.68,0:11:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,其中一个被称为战无不胜的高卢人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and one by word marked as the undefeated Gaul.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.96,0:11:41.35,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Crixus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.60,0:11:45.06,Default,,0,0,0,,他还活着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He yet lives?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.86,0:11:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,只是再多活一天罢了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only to see sun break dawn once more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.00,0:11:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛就快要结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The games come to an end when it sets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.90,0:11:55.33,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也即将没命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As do the lives of your men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.85,0:12:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯逃过一死\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus yet evades death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.09,0:12:26.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们却要死翘翘了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}While we fucking embrace it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.73,0:12:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以等到妮维雅了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I will embrace Naevia.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,我在另一个世界等她重回我的怀抱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}When she is returned to my arms in the afterlife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.57,0:12:36.95,Default,,0,0,0,,梅莉塔也在那里等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where Melitta awaits you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.76,0:12:43.82,Default,,0,0,0,,我渴望已久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I long for reunion.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.83,0:12:46.78,Default,,0,0,0,,还有话要问她呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the answers it will bring.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.27,0:13:02.55,Default,,0,0,0,,民众是何等疯狂啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How you will stir the crowd!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.68,0:13:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,到处都是甘尼克斯如何英勇的传说\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Tales of the prowess of Gannicus yet fill the air,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.27,0:13:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,堪与赫拉克勒斯(大力神)媲美\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}rivaling those of Hercules himself!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.32,0:13:09.94,Default,,0,0,0,,他得到的奖励是不朽的生命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}His labors were rewarded with immortality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.14,0:13:12.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你多幸运啊 我只要银子就行了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fortunate for you I seek more earthly payment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.89,0:13:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,事成之后一定给你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To be provided upon completion of your services.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.83,0:13:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我缺钱花\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I find myself light of coin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.00,0:13:20.11,Default,,0,0,0,,给我一点儿吧 只当是定金\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A few dropped in hand would anchor purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.25,0:13:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.77,0:13:26.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不希望等到约定的时间你就消失了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not wish to see wind carry you aloft short of the appointed hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.05,0:13:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,你就放心吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall see it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.25,0:13:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,到时候肯定很壮观\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will be glorious spectacle!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.30,0:13:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.85,0:13:38.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我带你去见行政官和民政官瓦里留斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would present you to the Magistrate and Praetor Varinius himself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.03,0:13:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们和那些大呼大叫的人一道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let them gaze upon the legend in the arena,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.77,0:13:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,在竞技场目睹传奇吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with the rest of the howling mob.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.53,0:13:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去喝酒了 还要找女人玩玩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am for wine, and the embrace of questionable women.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.63,0:14:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么死的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}How did he fall?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.07,0:14:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我们追踪的时候碰见了斯巴达克斯他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We came upon Spartacus and his men while giving chase.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.97,0:14:10.21,Default,,0,0,0,,就是那个混蛋杀了他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The villain himself delivered grievous injury.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.36,0:14:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,而你还站在我面前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And yet you stand before me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.15,0:14:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,能说能走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}drawing breath.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.22,0:14:15.77,Default,,0,0,0,,我救了你的护民官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I came to your tribune's aid,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.77,0:14:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,给他的伤口止血 保住他的性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}pulling him away to staunch life flowing from wound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.82,0:14:20.06,Default,,0,0,0,,多么高尚啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Noble effort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,- 可屁用没有 - 民政官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Bearing no fruit. - Praetor{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.22,0:14:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,告诉阿比努斯元老\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Send word to Senator Albinius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.64,0:14:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯不能跟那些奴隶一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus will not be among the slaves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.12,0:14:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,在明天的比赛中处决了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}executed at tomorrows games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.77,0:14:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,叙利亚人呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the Syrian?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.56,0:14:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,他可以在战场上证明自己的价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Oh, he will yet have chance to afford himself in battle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.89,0:14:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,在竞技场上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In the arena,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.86,0:14:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,跟那些没用的奴隶一并处决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to be executed with the other worthless slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.37,0:14:35.98,Default,,0,0,0,,不要 民政官 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No! Praetor, I beg of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.08,0:14:37.33,Default,,0,0,0,,民政官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Praetor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.20,0:14:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,又让人失望了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet another disappointment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.04,0:14:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,可怜的盖尤斯再次让斯巴达克斯逃了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus evades poor Gaius once again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.06,0:14:58.42,Default,,0,0,0,,色雷斯人缺席 你的比赛恐怕会失色不少\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I fear your games will suffer from the Thracian's absence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.42,0:15:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,蒙卡图向我保证过 场面一定很精彩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Good Mercato assures me grand spectacle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.80,0:15:06.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会让你丈夫的失败搅了大家的兴致\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have your husband's failure dampen spirits.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.50,0:15:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不会让他保住这个身份\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I would not have him remain so titled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.86,0:15:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们就是来讨论这件事的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The very purpose of our gathering.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.03,0:15:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,听说你有意娶我的爱女 我很高兴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}News of your desires towards loving daughter lifts heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.80,0:15:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们不能操之过急\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet we must proceed with caution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.63,0:15:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,婚约解除之前\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not have Gaius aware of our plans{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.60,0:15:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的计划不能让盖尤斯知道\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}until presented with dissolution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.20,0:15:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那就容我们先告辞\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us take leave,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.21,0:15:35.19,Default,,0,0,0,,好好讨论怎样行动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and further discuss how to proceed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.27,0:15:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我盼着早日摆脱束缚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I long for constraints to be shed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,跟你一起回罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and our fortunes returned to Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.27,0:15:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我也盼着你早日到我身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I long for you by my side,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.09,0:15:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,成为我的妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}holding position of wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:54.69,Default,,0,0,0,,按计划拿掉累赘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Remove encumbrance as discussed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.69,0:15:57.23,Default,,0,0,0,,确保办成这件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and we will see this to proper end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.78,0:16:02.31,Default,,0,0,0,,累赘\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Encumbrance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:06.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我要解除和他的血脉联系\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am to untether myself from unfortunate lineage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.26,0:16:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,你要打掉亲骨肉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would see your child never born?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.41,0:16:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,这是必要的牺牲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A necessary thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.13,0:16:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,确保有正统的继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To ensure a more worthy heir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.17,0:16:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我欠你一份情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I am in your debt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.15,0:16:33.28,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯说了你为纳西尔做的事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus told me what you have done for Nasir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.28,0:16:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,如果不是你…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If it were not for you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.18,0:16:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,他是为了我才差点丢掉性命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's because of me that he lays near death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.77,0:16:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不应该到矿上去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They never should have come to the mines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.75,0:16:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我也尽力阻止过他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I did what I could to stop them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.71,0:16:44.25,Default,,0,0,0,,可你做的还不够\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Would that you had done more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.18,0:16:45.75,Default,,0,0,0,,妮维雅…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Naevia...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.75,0:16:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,我活着的唯一希望就是再见他一面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The hope of seeing Crixus again was all that kept me alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.31,0:16:56.33,Default,,0,0,0,,我每天祈求诸神让他回到我的怀抱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Each day I begged the gods to see him to my arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.85,0:17:00.29,Default,,0,0,0,,难道就求到了这个结果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And this is how they fucking answer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.42,0:17:02.23,Default,,0,0,0,,只是匆匆一眼\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}By allowing his touch,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.36,0:17:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,就永远地从我身边夺走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}only to be ripped from it forever?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.68,0:17:07.87,Default,,0,0,0,,没人能动摇他救你的决心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He would not be swayed from attempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.78,0:17:12.21,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都是一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}None of them would.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.26,0:17:15.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我真希望露迪雅当初杀了我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish Lucretia had taken my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.38,0:17:20.52,Default,,0,0,0,,克雷斯就不会为了我这样的废物\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then Crixus would not have to sacrificed his{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.72,0:17:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,而牺牲自己\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for something soiled and ruined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.06,0:17:24.71,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯有事找你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus calls for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.61,0:17:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,纳西尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nasir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.01,0:17:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,他还在抗争\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He yet fights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.20,0:17:55.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都是\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As do we all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.49,0:17:58.70,Default,,0,0,0,,罗马人可就不这么想了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Romans would have it believed otherwise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.03,0:18:01.94,Default,,0,0,0,,卢修斯说有人传言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lucius tells of spreading word,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我们全军覆没了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that we are all but defeated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.91,0:18:05.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那就放马过来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let them come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.30,0:18:06.90,Default,,0,0,0,,让他们看个清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And find assumption false.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.91,0:18:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想再等下去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not wait for such a day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.98,0:18:12.57,Default,,0,0,0,,不想再看到兄弟们死在竞技场上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nor see our brothers fall in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.89,0:18:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,你要攻打竞技场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You would lay attack on the arena?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.63,0:18:19.92,Default,,0,0,0,,我们势单力薄\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Our numbers are low.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.92,0:18:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,能上阵的就更少了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}More so of men able with sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.63,0:18:24.03,Default,,0,0,0,,葛雷博和他的军队自然也清楚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing known by Glaber and his soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.66,0:18:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,所以绝对想不到我们会突袭\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They would never think us to make attempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.39,0:18:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,真他妈亏你想得出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For good fucking reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.79,0:18:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,谁还能比曾经在那里面\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who is more familiar with the arena,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.12,0:18:33.63,Default,,0,0,0,,拼命厮杀的人更了解竞技场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}than men who have fought upon its sands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.62,0:18:42.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你想怎么干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are your thoughts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.44,0:18:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,近日的行刑其实是杀鸡儆猴\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These executions serve as message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.32,0:18:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,警告世人罗马会摧毁任何企图反抗的势力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}That Rome will smother any flame that burns against it's rule.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.33,0:18:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我也要回敬他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would send message of our own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.80,0:18:59.09,Default,,0,0,0,,把所有奴隶心底的怒火点燃\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One that will ignite the hearts of all yet enslaved.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.37,0:19:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,确实很难下手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a heavy burden.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.20,0:19:21.03,Default,,0,0,0,,亲手扼杀你肚子里的骨血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Stilling life that grows inside you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.03,0:19:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我先前想得太轻松了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I had thought deed of lighter concern.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.13,0:19:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,也不知道为何下不了手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not know why I pause.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.54,0:19:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,女人生性就是要保护孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A woman will always be moved to protect her child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.15,0:19:33.85,Default,,0,0,0,,可我别无选择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet it must be done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.37,0:19:37.76,Default,,0,0,0,,可能晚点动手才是明智之举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps it wise to delay the act.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.38,0:19:40.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你缺席竞技场的事 肯定会引起注意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your absence at the games will draw notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.92,0:19:42.20,Default,,0,0,0,,缺席\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My absence?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.54,0:19:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经让巴蒂塔斯家的很多奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have forced silphium on many slaves,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.62,0:19:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你会感到虚弱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will sicken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.36,0:19:51.74,Default,,0,0,0,,还会失血\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And bleed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.75,0:19:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,持续好多天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For many days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.23,0:19:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你父亲非要你这样做\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will attest such to your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.05,0:20:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我可以帮你在他面前说明\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If he so presses for reason of staying hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.16,0:20:10.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你的建议很好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You prove wise counsel.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.87,0:20:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我愿意一直帮你参谋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A service I would continue to provide.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.08,0:20:23.97,Default,,0,0,0,,你想跟我去罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you wish to accompany me to Rome?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.97,0:20:27.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我只想追随在你左右\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish only to be at your side.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.00,0:20:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之间有很多难以释怀的过去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There is yet much of the past between us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.63,0:20:39.03,Default,,0,0,0,,那就看看有没有未来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us see if there is a future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.12,0:20:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Be quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.06,0:21:00.43,Default,,0,0,0,,终于还是来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At last she comes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.43,0:21:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我有别的事情要处理\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Other matters have drawn my attention.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.19,0:21:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,那现在也该解决我的事情了吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see it towards current fucking plight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.04,0:21:11.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得我会眼睁睁看着你送死吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do you think that I would allow you to perish upon the sands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.28,0:21:12.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你为我做了那么多\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}After all you have done for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.98,0:21:15.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我会跟葛雷博谈谈…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will break words with Glaber{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:19.76,Default,,0,0,0,,没抓住斯巴达克斯的责任 他怪到我头上了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He places blame for Spartacus evading capture.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.72,0:21:24.41,Default,,0,0,0,,他不会听你的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He will not listen to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.45,0:21:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,但他会倾听诸神的意愿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet he will heed the will of the gods,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.50,0:21:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,正如他先前所做的一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}as he has so graciously in the past.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.79,0:21:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我会告诉他的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I shall whisper of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.69,0:21:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,你如何从黑暗森林回到我们身边助一臂之力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of how you were returned to us from dark woods for a purpose.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.62,0:21:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神对于你有何安排\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Of how the gods yet have use for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.82,0:21:40.40,Default,,0,0,0,,和我一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As do I.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.68,0:21:44.55,Default,,0,0,0,,你想让我做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What would you have of me now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.00,0:21:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,伊莉西娅的珠宝盒里有个红色的小药瓶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There's a red vial secreted among Ilithyia's jewelry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.15,0:21:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我想让你把里面的东西换成苦草和水\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see its contents replaced with water and bitter herb.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.91,0:22:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经在这宅子里见过红色的药瓶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've seen such red vials within this house before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.77,0:22:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,也见识过它的效果\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And witnessed their effect.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.99,0:22:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,如果药瓶没有起作用\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And when none are presented,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.24,0:22:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,那就说明上天注定要这孩子降生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}it will be taken as a sign that her child must be born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.13,0:22:09.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这事你自己来不是更轻而易举\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A task easier seen by your own hand.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.57,0:22:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,你和她很亲近 在宅子里行动更自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are close to her, and move freely through the villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.38,0:22:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我一旦被发现 风险太大\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The risk of discovery is too great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.32,0:22:16.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不能让伊莉西娅有理由怀疑我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ilithyia must be given no reason to doubt me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.85,0:22:18.52,Default,,0,0,0,,否则我们都完了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or all will fall to ruin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.52,0:22:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,你让我怎么办得到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And how am I to do such a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.26,0:22:22.53,Default,,0,0,0,,即便我自由了 我也不是幽灵\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Even free of bondage I am no spirit,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.53,0:22:24.31,Default,,0,0,0,,可以畅通无阻地进门\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}able to pass through fucking gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.31,0:22:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前不是这宅子的主人吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Was I not the domina of this house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.15,0:22:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,进门不是问题\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gates part in remembrance...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.70,0:22:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,要是我被发现了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if I am discovered?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.15,0:22:56.55,Default,,0,0,0,,别被发现\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Do not be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.14,0:23:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,为了获得自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will see myself freed of bondage.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.84,0:23:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我什么都干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}At any cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.01,0:23:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,这种事情可能做到吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is such a thing possible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.15,0:23:15.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我能做到\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see it so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.50,0:23:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,大不了跟克雷斯死在竞技场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Or fall with Crixus in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.76,0:23:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,如果诸神保佑的话\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If the gods yet care,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.63,0:23:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你们能平安归来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}may they speed your return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.33,0:23:23.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where do we go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.01,0:23:26.29,Default,,0,0,0,,纳西尔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Nasir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.93,0:23:30.31,Default,,0,0,0,,把剑给我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give me a sword.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.67,0:23:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,我和你们一起走\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will join you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.48,0:23:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你再休息一段时间\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would have you rest yet a while longer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.70,0:23:36.00,Default,,0,0,0,,这次你留下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This time you stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.00,0:23:37.25,Default,,0,0,0,,我去杀敌\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And I go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.15,0:23:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得行动了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.29,0:23:52.85,Default,,0,0,0,,这孩子死里逃生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The boy cheats death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.03,0:23:55.79,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是好兆头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Perhaps it is a sign.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.01,0:23:58.65,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不能依靠兆头\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can not rely on omen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.01,0:24:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的力量来自于正义以及实现它的决心\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must take strength in just cause, and bring it to bear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.90,0:24:09.07,Default,,0,0,0,,你们都听到了关于我们行动的闲言碎语\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You have all heard whispers of what we attempt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.92,0:24:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,现在由我来给大家确定的消息\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would overtake soft voice with bold words.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.28,0:24:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要去卡普亚的竞技场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are for the arena in Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.90,0:24:20.91,Default,,0,0,0,,那如果你们回不来呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And if you do not return?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.32,0:24:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,卢修斯•凯利乌斯知道该去哪儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Lucius Caelius knows these lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.84,0:24:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们去的时间太久\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If we are too long from you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.30,0:24:27.83,Default,,0,0,0,,那我请求他给你们指一条明路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would ask that he show you safe path.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.61,0:24:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,远远地离开葛雷博及其爪牙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Far from the reach of Glaber and his soldiers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.47,0:24:35.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我们都饱尝了痛苦\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have suffered wound and loss.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.29,0:24:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,与家人分离\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We have been divided.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.12,0:24:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,但我们是自由的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet we are free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.79,0:24:44.26,Default,,0,0,0,,自由是无价的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing beyond price.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.02,0:24:50.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我要让身陷囹圄的兄弟再次获得自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A thing I would see condemned brothers embrace once again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.49,0:24:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,同时这一举动\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in the doing of it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.64,0:24:55.67,Default,,0,0,0,,也是向所有仍卑躬屈膝的奴隶宣告\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}spread word to every slave yet beneath heel{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.67,0:24:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,所谓强大的共和国 也是能击垮的血肉之躯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}that even the mighty Republic bleeds when struck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.96,0:25:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,你真是威猛无比\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You fuck like a god...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.14,0:26:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我也想来一杯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would share a cup...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.05,0:26:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,恢复一下气力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to regain sense...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.03,0:26:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我以前没见过你 对吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have not seen you here before, have I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.62,0:26:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经好多年没回卡普亚了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've been many years from Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.31,0:26:16.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那什么风把你吹回来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What brings return?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.13,0:26:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,为了比赛才回来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I come for the games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.50,0:26:22.01,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望我也能看\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wish I could see them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.46,0:26:24.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我宁愿换下位子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will trade place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.53,0:26:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你站在沙场上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You stand upon the sands{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.68,0:26:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,我就喝个痛快 操到死为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and I will drink and fuck until the gods take me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.34,0:26:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,沙场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The sands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.34,0:26:35.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你是甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are Gannicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.08,0:26:37.07,Default,,0,0,0,,那个赢得自由身的角斗士\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The gladiator who gained his freedom!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.07,0:26:38.56,Default,,0,0,0,,灰暗无望的自由\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Shadow of the same.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.63,0:26:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,我还没听说过有别人赢得鲁迪斯呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I've never heard of another who's won the rudis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.71,0:26:43.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我能摸摸吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May I touch it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.70,0:26:47.94,Default,,0,0,0,,这些记号\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}These markings...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.95,0:26:49.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是你的胜利记录吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They tell of your victories?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.75,0:26:56.84,Default,,0,0,0,,是沙场的荣耀 已经遗忘太久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They tell of glories, long forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.80,0:27:03.21,Default,,0,0,0,,既然看到了不舒服 为什么还带着\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why do you carry it, if it troubles mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.61,0:27:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须随时带在身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It must always remain at my side,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.00,0:27:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,即便是在竞技场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}even in the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.55,0:27:11.81,Default,,0,0,0,,以此证明我不再是奴隶\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Proof that I am no longer a slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.03,0:27:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,也提醒我还是奴隶时所作出的抉择\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Reminder of choices made while I was yet one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.33,0:27:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,梅莉塔\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Melitta!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.40,0:27:25.96,Default,,0,0,0,,呼吸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Breathe!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.55,0:27:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,闲话到此为止\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us put talk behind us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.38,0:27:32.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我要睡觉了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would fall to bed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.62,0:27:37.27,Default,,0,0,0,,美酒 还有你的美腿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wine and the memory of your thighs{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.27,0:27:39.58,Default,,0,0,0,,是我迎接明天的动力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to brace against coming day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.78,0:28:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,这样也好\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a blessing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.39,0:28:20.28,Default,,0,0,0,,再也不用回到这该死的宅子了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To be forever removed from this fucking house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.47,0:28:22.65,Default,,0,0,0,,真希望看它化为齑粉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May it crumble in our wake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.47,0:28:32.23,Default,,0,0,0,,把他们带到竞技场去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See them delivered to the arena,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.23,0:28:34.62,Default,,0,0,0,,准备行刑\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}prepared for execution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.48,0:28:36.59,Default,,0,0,0,,遵命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.73,0:28:39.68,Default,,0,0,0,,民政官大人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Praetor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.68,0:28:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 能和您说句话吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies, I would have word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.35,0:28:42.97,Default,,0,0,0,,我暂且饶你一条命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You draw breath only because Lucretia{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.97,0:28:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是因为露迪雅说诸神预言你还有价值\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}cautions the gods yet foretell of your worth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.90,0:28:48.18,Default,,0,0,0,,再惹我 我管你他妈的预言\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Press me, and see prophecy ignored.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.18,0:28:51.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我正是为了实现预言 就在今日\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I but wish to fulfill it, this very day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.78,0:28:53.06,Default,,0,0,0,,预备\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.15,0:28:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}March.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.43,0:28:59.10,Default,,0,0,0,,那就快说 让我们瞧瞧诸神的能耐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Speak then, and let us gauge divinity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.92,0:29:03.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我看见了很有趣的一件事\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My eyes fell upon most curious sight,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.58,0:29:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,就是从房间里看见的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}witnessed from my cell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.68,0:29:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,您妻子的奴隶晚上偷偷摸摸地进去\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your wife's slave stealing through the night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.92,0:29:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,她手里拿的东西我很熟悉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}In her hand a thing familiar to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.28,0:29:16.28,Default,,0,0,0,,恐怕您完全蒙在鼓里…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One I fear you may have no knowledge of...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.63,0:29:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,把水和酒都给我备足了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}See the litter well stocked with water and wine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.35,0:29:22.78,Default,,0,0,0,,这么热的天气 我不能在瓦里留斯跟前失态\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would not stand before Varinius parched from this fucking heat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.98,0:29:24.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是 主人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yes, Domina.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.96,0:29:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,盖尤斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gaius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.77,0:29:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你和手下都去竞技场了呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I thought you for the arena with your men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.29,0:29:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,诸神有没有见过你这样的美人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have the gods ever beheld such beauty?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.90,0:29:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,承蒙夸奖\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You flatter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.79,0:29:42.92,Default,,0,0,0,,退下吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Leave us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.90,0:29:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,我们要错过约定的时间了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will be past the appointed hour.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.79,0:29:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,他们可以等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They will wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.82,0:29:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,正如我在等\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As I have waited,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.48,0:29:53.56,Default,,0,0,0,,等待期盼已久的赐福\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}for blessings longed for...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.63,0:29:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那一天当然值得纪念\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It will be a glorious day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.70,0:30:02.41,Default,,0,0,0,,可你却不想看到那一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}One you would see never arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.87,0:30:13.52,Default,,0,0,0,,- 盖尤斯… - 别他妈的哄我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}- Gaius... - Do not fucking attempt lie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.74,0:30:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道这是什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I know what I hold.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.15,0:30:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,也知道你要它做什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And the intent it carries.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.15,0:30:28.41,Default,,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.91,0:30:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,因为你不配拥有继承人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Because you are not worthy of an heir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.10,0:30:38.05,Default,,0,0,0,,你不配跟我在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are not worthy of me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.27,0:30:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,我们已经形同陌路了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have we drifted so far?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.00,0:30:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们曾经那么相爱\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}From the love we once held?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.02,0:30:51.41,Default,,0,0,0,,那份爱已经远远地离开了海岸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is a speck upon distant shore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.77,0:30:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,小得看不见了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Too small to draw notice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.11,0:31:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我一定要抱上孩子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will hold my child in my arms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.66,0:31:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你也要扮演好母亲和妻子的角色\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you will play part of dutiful mother and wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.28,0:31:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,我不干\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.14,0:31:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你要听从丈夫的命令\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will do as your husband commands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.02,0:31:11.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那我希望瓦里留斯用温柔的语气说出来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Then I pray Varinius gives them with softer voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.04,0:31:13.31,Default,,0,0,0,,瓦里留斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Varinius?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.32,0:31:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲为了我的大好前途\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My father dissolves our marriage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.14,0:31:17.42,Default,,0,0,0,,解除了我们的婚约\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in favor of more promising opportunity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.90,0:31:21.85,Default,,0,0,0,,比赛结束后 我就跟他回罗马\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I return with him to Rome at the close of the games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.68,0:31:25.13,Default,,0,0,0,,你们竟敢算计我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You conspire against me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.23,0:31:26.54,Default,,0,0,0,,这是逼不得已\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We do what we must,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.54,0:31:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,谁叫你越来越让人失望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}in face of growing disappointment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.25,0:31:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我要去跟你父亲谈谈\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will have words with your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.24,0:31:32.24,Default,,0,0,0,,有必要吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To what end?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.24,0:31:34.07,Default,,0,0,0,,他当初答应让我们在一起\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He allowed you my hand only because I begged{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.07,0:31:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,只因我泪汪汪地诉说我有多么爱你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}with teary eye, wet with thoughts of love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.83,0:31:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在我没有眼泪了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They now stand dry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.25,0:31:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,就像没有雨水滋润的沙漠\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A desert deprived of rain.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.34,0:31:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,我们之间什么都没有了吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is there nothing left between us?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.92,0:31:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,只有回忆了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Memories only.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.85,0:31:58.93,Default,,0,0,0,,不过终究会消失\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet they too shall fade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.81,0:32:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,来吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.02,0:32:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们最后一次作为夫妻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us present ourselves as husband and wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.82,0:32:07.26,Default,,0,0,0,,观看比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For the last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.40,0:32:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,民众开始不高兴了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The crowd has turned to sour mood.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.02,0:32:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,这可不能怪他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We can place no blame.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.46,0:32:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,要怪就怪迟迟不来的某人吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Except perhaps upon cause of delay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.59,0:32:29.93,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Apologies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.05,0:32:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我夫君遇到了意料之外的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}My husband found himself distracted by unexpected concerns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.90,0:32:35.57,Default,,0,0,0,,那一定是很重要的事情吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Matters of great import then,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.57,0:32:38.20,Default,,0,0,0,,让所有的贵客和卡普亚全体子民等你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to keep honored guest and all of Capua waiting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:38.20,0:32:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,确实是很紧急的事情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It was of a pressing nature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.84,0:32:43.71,Default,,0,0,0,,在我看来 过去的事就过去吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would condemn such transgressions to distant past,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.71,0:32:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,要着眼于更值得关注的未来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}and turn eye toward more deserving future.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.67,0:32:48.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾经为此夜不能寐\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Such thoughts kept sleep at bay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.50,0:32:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,希望今天的场面能让你高兴起来\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I pray the conclusion of this day brings you comfort.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.80,0:32:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,正如你的赐福让民众高兴起来一样\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As you have brought to all touched by your divine presence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.13,0:32:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,那我们别等了 开始吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us begin, and see it come to pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.54,0:33:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,还等什么呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What are we waiting for?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.10,0:33:06.69,Default,,0,0,0,,快点开始\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Get on with it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.50,0:33:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,卡普亚的子民们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Citizens of Capua!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.25,0:33:12.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我们今日齐聚于此\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We gather this day to witness an end{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.37,0:33:15.36,Default,,0,0,0,,欣赏由鄙人普布利乌斯•瓦里留斯带来的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to the storied games of your humble editor,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.38,0:33:17.49,Default,,0,0,0,,传奇之战的谢幕\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Publius Varinius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.18,0:33:19.83,Default,,0,0,0,,而在闭幕之时\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And in their closing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.83,0:33:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我当然要尊重\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}know that I have not forgone the mores{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.95,0:33:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,正午行刑的习俗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}of noonday execution.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.28,0:33:27.50,Default,,0,0,0,,不过行刑者的身份要提高到骁将的级别\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}But rather, find tradition exalted to position of the primus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.51,0:33:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,每一场比赛的胜负\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And each contest that leads us to it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.69,0:33:34.21,Default,,0,0,0,,直接决定谁有权为罗马主持正义\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}shall determine which men stand worthy to deliver the justice of Rome!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.23,0:33:40.15,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们停止等待 迎接鲜血的盛宴吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let spectacles of blood no longer hold pause!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.15,0:33:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,有请撒姆尼角斗士 麦科特\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enter Mycter Samnite!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.45,0:33:52.87,Default,,0,0,0,,有请鱼盔角斗士 艾比隆\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enter Abiron Murmillo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.80,0:34:02.40,Default,,0,0,0,,希望诸神让我们度过\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}May the gods bless us with a day{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.40,0:34:04.49,Default,,0,0,0,,永垂青史的一天\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}forever etched upon memory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.91,0:34:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,开战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Begin!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.17,0:34:35.04,Default,,0,0,0,,杀 杀 杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill! Kill! Kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.22,0:35:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,真是惊天动地的表演\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A display to shake the heavens!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.13,0:35:29.35,Default,,0,0,0,,蒙卡图 你真会给角斗士配对呀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You possess a gift for the pairing of gladiators, Mercato!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.35,0:35:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,你有没有想过到罗马去做生意\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Have you ever considered plying such trade in Rome?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.73,0:35:33.02,Default,,0,0,0,,您抬举我了 民政官\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You honor me, Praetor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.02,0:35:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,可惜我的风水宝地是卡普亚\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet my fortunes are tied to Capua.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.09,0:35:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是不是凡有点名气的人 你都想挖走啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Is it your intent to spirit away everyone of note?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.21,0:35:40.09,Default,,0,0,0,,哪里哪里 就几个\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have thoughts toward but a few.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.08,0:35:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,你丈夫的眼神似乎酝酿着狂风暴雨啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your husband's eyes betray darkening storm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.75,0:35:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,他在我的卧房里看到了不该看到的东西\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has made unfortunate discovery, within my bedchambers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.26,0:36:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,真是不该啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Unfortunate indeed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.24,0:36:51.05,Default,,0,0,0,,终于到了决定骁将的最后一场比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We reach final contest before the primus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.82,0:36:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,谁能表现出有如神助的实力\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who shall prove himself a god,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.43,0:36:57.58,Default,,0,0,0,,拥有为罗马人杀戮叛贼的权利\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}worthy to take vengeance against the enemies of Rome?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.35,0:37:02.35,Default,,0,0,0,,有请重装角斗士 玛索利亚斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enter Masonius Hoplomachus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.04,0:37:07.50,Default,,0,0,0,,有请鱼盔角斗士 斯特拉博\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Enter Strabo Murmillo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.47,0:38:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,杀 杀 杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill! Kill! Kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.85,0:38:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,精彩的对决\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A fine showing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:25.25,0:38:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,将永远为狂热的民众所铭记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To be forever remembered by adoring crowd.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:27.78,0:38:29.41,Default,,0,0,0,,正如赐予他们如此盛宴的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As will the name Varinius,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.41,0:38:31.46,Default,,0,0,0,,你瓦里留斯的名字\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}who bestows such generous gifts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.46,0:38:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,的确 他永远不会被忘记\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Indeed. He shall never be forgotten.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.46,0:38:36.34,Default,,0,0,0,,有的人就未必了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Same cannot be said of all men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.58,0:38:41.45,Default,,0,0,0,,行刑开始了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The executions begin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.42,0:38:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,杀 杀 杀\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill! Kill! Kill!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.45,0:38:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,两个人对付一支军队\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Two against an army?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.15,0:38:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我可不看好你们的胜率\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I do not care for your odds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.69,0:38:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,那你就等着瞧好了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You will see them towards our favor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.77,0:39:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,你知道怎么做吗\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are clear to your purpose?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.27,0:39:01.63,Default,,0,0,0,,我们会办成的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will see it done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.85,0:39:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,知道有你在身边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It gives strength.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.39,0:39:06.07,Default,,0,0,0,,给了我勇气和力量\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Knowing you stand with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.55,0:39:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,我们得快点\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must work quickly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.94,0:39:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你们还信神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If any of you hold faith in any gods,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.80,0:39:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,那就赶紧向他们祈祷\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}now would be time to fucking entreat them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.17,0:39:26.65,Default,,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Quick! Quick!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.81,0:39:29.22,Default,,0,0,0,,汉尼拔来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hannibal stands at our gates!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.22,0:39:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,这是罗马人用来吓唬小孩的说法\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A phrase used to invoke fear among the children of Rome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.50,0:39:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,迦太基野兽的幽灵…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A specter of the Carthaginian animal...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.14,0:39:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,多少年了 我一直想重回竞技场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}For many years I have dreamed of my return to the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.62,0:39:42.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我很荣幸\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It is an honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.61,0:39:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,能与你并肩上场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}To stand beside you upon the sands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.65,0:39:48.37,Default,,0,0,0,,汉尼拔最终命丧罗马人剑下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Hannibal passed from this life at the end of a Roman sword!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.44,0:39:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你们的时辰到了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your time has come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.92,0:39:54.34,Default,,0,0,0,,叛贼斯巴达克斯终有一天也是同样的下场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A fate that will one day be shared by the rebel Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.19,0:40:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,我们的剑没有开锋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They give us swords absent fucking edge.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.63,0:40:07.33,Default,,0,0,0,,也没有胜利的希望\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Absent hope of victory as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.47,0:40:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,那就让他们知道 给我们剑是大错特错\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us prove them fools for giving us swords at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.87,0:40:23.87,Default,,0,0,0,,杀了这帮畜生\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill those Bastards!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.41,0:40:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,准备受死吧 你们这些混蛋\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I hope you die! Fuckers!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.43,0:40:45.57,Default,,0,0,0,,我要你们开膛破肚 臭囚犯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I wanna see your insides, prisoners!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.65,0:41:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,今天真是荣幸啊\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This day grants undeserved honor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.58,0:41:13.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直希望跟最伟大的冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have longed to share the sands with Gannicus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:14.42,0:41:16.74,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯同场竞技\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}the greatest champion ever to enter the arena.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.74,0:41:18.88,Default,,0,0,0,,这儿没什么冠军\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There stand no champions here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:18.95,0:41:20.71,Default,,0,0,0,,只有凡人和他们的命运\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Only men and their fates.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.72,0:41:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,谁能领导罗马的行刑者\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Yet who shall lead the forces of Rome?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:25.08,0:41:27.77,Default,,0,0,0,,谁配得上如此传奇的一战\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Who deserves such storied mantle?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:29.07,0:41:30.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你是巴蒂塔斯家的人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You are from the House of Batiatus?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.67,0:41:32.20,Default,,0,0,0,,只有一个人\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}There stands but one!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.41,0:41:34.43,Default,,0,0,0,,上辈子的事儿\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A lifetime ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.43,0:41:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,现在你要上场\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And now you take to the sands,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.14,0:41:37.93,Default,,0,0,0,,要你兄弟们的命\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}to claim the lives of your brothers?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.95,0:41:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,既然他们必须死 我就送他们体面地上路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}If they must fall, I would see them to honorable death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.52,0:41:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,真正的竞技场之神\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A true God of the Arena!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.41,0:41:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,至少杀他们的人 心里还记挂着他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Given by one who yet holds them to heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.56,0:41:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,有请甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I give you Gannicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.89,0:41:58.14,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.34,0:42:03.45,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.46,0:42:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,甘尼克斯 甘尼克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gannicus! Gannicus! Gannicus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.67,0:42:20.54,Default,,0,0,0,,我都要怀疑这鬼计划靠不靠谱了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I begin to question fucking plan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.80,0:42:22.15,Default,,0,0,0,,我们各有任务\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We are committed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.00,0:42:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,要有信心 准备好…\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Steel nerve, and be ready for{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.85,0:42:47.46,Default,,0,0,0,,她是我妻子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}She was my wife.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.48,0:42:55.25,Default,,0,0,0,,而你是我兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}And you my brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.25,0:42:56.13,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.57,0:43:00.16,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He is mine!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.94,0:43:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这里\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This is the place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.72,0:43:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你们干什么\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}You there?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.89,0:43:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Halt!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:36.73,0:43:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,高卢人终于要死了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The Gaul finally nears his end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.60,0:43:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,早就该这样了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}A fate long overdue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.95,0:44:08.17,Default,,0,0,0,,他们耽搁太久了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}They take too long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.31,0:44:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们必须等待 不然努力就白费了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must wait or see effort failed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.57,0:44:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我也不希望对她动感情\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never wanted to feel what I felt for her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.38,0:44:23.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我不想这样的\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I never wanted any of this!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:47.13,0:44:48.87,Default,,0,0,0,,莱斯克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Rhaskos!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.27,0:44:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,操\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Fuck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.26,0:44:58.37,Default,,0,0,0,,稳住\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.69,0:45:21.25,Default,,0,0,0,,烧得不够快\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}It's not working fast enough!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.06,0:45:24.05,Default,,0,0,0,,链子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The chains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:24.05,0:45:25.81,Default,,0,0,0,,缠住柱子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Wrap them around the supports.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.17,0:46:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.50,0:46:05.13,Default,,0,0,0,,拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.54,0:46:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,我送你去见她 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I will send you to her arms, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.57,0:46:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,拉\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Pull!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.41,0:47:01.48,Default,,0,0,0,,冲\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.92,0:47:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,出什么事了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}What's happening?!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.73,0:47:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,快离开\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let's get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.63,0:47:38.45,Default,,0,0,0,,清开道路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clear way!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.45,0:47:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,快清开道路\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Clear fucking way{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.68,0:47:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,蒙卡图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mercato!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.12,0:47:58.46,Default,,0,0,0,,蒙卡图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mercato!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.02,0:48:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,蒙卡图\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Mercato!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.20,0:48:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我要救你们出去 兄弟\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I would see us gone from here, brother.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.63,0:48:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,杀掉他们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Kill them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:51.89,0:48:53.04,Default,,0,0,0,,来帮忙\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Give hand!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.59,0:49:22.24,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.25,0:49:32.80,Default,,0,0,0,,科萨特斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Cossutius!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.37,0:49:49.89,Default,,0,0,0,,可以出去了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}The path is clear!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.45,0:49:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯又一次耍了你\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus once again makes fool of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.49,0:50:00.15,Default,,0,0,0,,你在元老院的好日子结束了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Your days in the Senate have found their end!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:31.44,0:50:32.35,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:32.35,0:50:33.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我们该走了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We must move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:33.22,0:50:36.42,Default,,0,0,0,,不行 我们要找到奥诺玛默斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}No, we must find Oenomaus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:38.38,0:50:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,这边\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:50.85,0:50:51.88,Default,,0,0,0,,盖尤斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gaius...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:52.50,0:50:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,救我\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Help me Please...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:54.47,0:50:56.03,Default,,0,0,0,,救我 求你了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Help me, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.70,0:51:13.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有你和你女儿想的那么傻\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I'm not the fool you and your daughter think me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.54,0:51:44.89,Default,,0,0,0,,帮我扶他\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Help me with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.00,0:52:18.91,Default,,0,0,0,,走 我能跟上\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Go. I will follow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.75,0:52:42.91,Default,,0,0,0,,斯巴达克斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.85,0:52:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我已经受够了角斗比赛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}I have had my fill of games.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.18,0:52:51.94,Default,,0,0,0,,我们永远离开竞技场吧\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Let us leave this arena forever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.68,0:52:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,市民们\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Citizens!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.22,0:53:01.16,Default,,0,0,0,,市民们 保持冷静\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Citizens, calm yourselves!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.98,0:53:03.33,Default,,0,0,0,,快召集你的手下\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gather your fucking men!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.33,0:53:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,来 我负责送你们回宅子\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Come. I would see you safe to the villa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.81,0:53:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,盖尤斯\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Gaius...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.68,0:53:11.13,Default,,0,0,0,,我父亲呢\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Where is my father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:12.31,0:53:15.46,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了 死于斯巴达克斯之手\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}He has fallen, at the hands of Spartacus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:30.80,0:53:32.30,Default,,0,0,0,,可我们活下来了\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}We will survive this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:33.35,0:53:34.44,Default,,0,0,0,,我们俩\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}Together.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:38.36,0:53:40.23,Default,,0,0,0,,还是恩爱夫妻嘛\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&\blur3}As husband and wife.{\r}
